OL,3,GNEWSAShocked walker finds SUV blocking
OL,4,Aroute on Wales Coast Path
OL,5,
OL,6,FStunned walker Canberk Beker could not
OL,7,Fbelieve his eyes when he came across a
OL,8,Fcar blocking his way on the Wales Coast
OL,9,FPath.
OL,11,FThe 31-year-old was out for a stroll
OL,12,Fwith wife Bethan Jones, also 31, when
OL,13,Fthey saw the blue Kia Sportage on
OL,14,FSaturday morning between Mumbles and
OL,15,FLangland Bay.
OL,17,FThe driver had managed to wedge the SUV
OL,18,Fbetween a concrete fence post on one
OL,19,Fside and a bench on the other.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
