OL,3,GNEWSAShocked walker finds SUV blocking
OL,4,Aroute on Wales Coast Path
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanberk, from Langland, in Swansea,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It was completely covering the
OL,8,Fpath. I was looking inside the car."
